Aim

To analyze how newsletters help in branding and customer engagement.

Beginner Level Exact Steps
Step 1: Open Browser

Open Google Chrome.

Step 2: Open Company Website

Open any company website that provides newsletters.

Examples:

Amazon
Flipkart
Netflix
Step 3: Search for Newsletter Subscription

Scroll to bottom of website.

Find:

Subscribe
Newsletter
Email updates
Step 4: Subscribe to Newsletter

Enter:

Email ID
Name

Click:

Subscribe
Step 5: Open Email Inbox

Open Gmail inbox.

Wait for newsletter email from company.

Step 6: Observe Newsletter Design

Analyze:

Logo
Colors
Images
Layout
Offers
Step 7: Study Branding Elements

Observe how company promotes brand using:

Brand name
Tagline
Product images
Company colors

Example:

Branding Element	Example
Logo	Amazon Logo
Color	Blue and White
Offer	Discount Sale
Step 8: Identify Customer Engagement Methods

Observe:

Discount offers
Product recommendations
Personalized greetings
Call To Action buttons

Example CTA:

Shop Now
Step 9: Analyze Newsletter Frequency

Check whether:

Weekly
Monthly
Quarterly

Example:

Weekly Newsletter
Step 10: Write Advantages of Newsletters
Advantages
Improves brand awareness
Increases customer engagement
Promotes products
Builds customer relationship
Increases website traffic
Step 11: Create Report in MS Word

Type:

Aim
Procedure
Branding analysis
Customer engagement methods
Advantages
Conclusion

Save as:

NewsletterBranding.docx
Step 12: Take Screenshots

Take screenshots of:

Newsletter email
Branding elements
CTA buttons
Promotional offers

